    <h1>ProxyIQ - Platform Run Through</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h1 id=3D"ProxyIQ-PlatformRunThrough-ProxyIQ-PlatformRunThrough">Pr=
oxyIQ - Platform Run Through</h1>
<h1 id=3D"ProxyIQ-PlatformRunThrough-Purposeofthedocument:">Purpose of the =
document:</h1>
<p>The document aims to outline the primary user journey and the step-by-st=
ep process involved in completing an order and marking it as paid on ProxyI=
Q, a healthcare platform. This document serves as a comprehensive guide for=
 users, detailing the key steps they need to follow to successfully navigat=
e through the order completion and payment confirmation process.</p>
<p local-id=3D"721c04f2869d"></p>
<p local-id=3D"12bf1b0c50e4"></p>
