<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Please go to the =E2=80=98Settings=E2=80=99</p></li>
<li>
<p>Click on =E2=80=98Account Management=E2=80=99 followed by =E2=80=98Creat=
e Account=E2=80=99.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Select =E2=80=98Vendor=E2=80=99.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Please fill the four tabs with the necessary data</p></li>
<li>
<p>Click on =E2=80=98Create Vendor User=E2=80=99</p></li>
</ol>
