<h2 id=3D"ProxyIQ-PlatformRunThrough-ConfirmReceipt:">Confirm Receipt:</h2>
<p>by <strong>Vendor</strong>:</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Please go to the dashboard or click on the notification received.</p></l=
i>
<li>
<p>Have a look at the order details and click on =E2=80=98Confirm receipt=
=E2=80=99</p></li>
</ol>
<p></p>
<p></p>
<h2 id=3D"ProxyIQ-PlatformRunThrough-OrdercompletionandEncountersubmission:=
">Order completion and Encounter submission:</h2>
<p>by <strong>Vendor</strong>:</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Vendor assesses the order and suggests corrections if necessary.</p></li=
>
<li>
<p>Vendor completes the delivery of the advised DMEs and confirms the same =
on the platform.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Vendor uploads the Proof of Delivery &amp; confirms the upload.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Vendor clicks on the check mark and submits the encounter.</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"d5bafa533a4a"></p>
<p local-id=3D"e6f8122dca13"></p>
