<h2 id=3D"ProxyIQ-PlatformRunThrough-ExporttheCSVofinvoicedetails:">Export =
the CSV of invoice details:</h2>
<p>by <strong>Facility</strong>:</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"402d45e6e8fd">
<li>
<p>Go to =E2=80=98Billing=E2=80=99.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Click on more (3 dots)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Click on =E2=80=98Export CSV File=E2=80=99.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Enter =E2=80=98Vendor=E2=80=99, =E2=80=98Invoice Status=E2=80=99, =E2=80=
=98Start and End date=E2=80=99.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Click on =E2=80=98Export=E2=80=99</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d0fbdc55757b">
<p local-id=3D"db118d758fdc">Send the CSV file to the ERP or accounts payab=
le as applicable.</p></li>
</ol>
<p></p>
<h2 id=3D"ProxyIQ-PlatformRunThrough-ImporttheCSVofpaymentdetails(auto-popu=
lation):">Import the CSV of payment details (auto-population):</h2>
<p>by <strong>Facility</strong>:</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"fa7306b34c91">
<li>
<p>Go to =E2=80=98Billing=E2=80=99.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Click on more (3 dots)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"65cff1e02659">
<p local-id=3D"7ab6a57a5902">Click on =E2=80=98Import CSV File=E2=80=99.</p=
></li>
<li local-id=3D"6905f85f0277">
<p local-id=3D"4972f9796a9d">Select the file from the device.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"36afa7c0d6bb">
<p>Click on =E2=80=98Import=E2=80=99. The details would auto-populate.</p><=
/li>
</ol>
<p></p>
<p></p>
